  "text": "If your child shows recurring anxiety (crying, clinging, fear of sleep): reassure them and note what you see. See a doctor or specialist, without waiting a set time, if it is not improving, gets worse, or affects sleep, play or friendships. Note: this is not a medical diagnosis.",
